ht narrative tone with dark jokes and black humor\u2014serious themes without overwhelming heaviness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Lively animations and musical accompaniment for total immersion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78The story has multiple branching paths and 13 endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78A<i> s</i>ecret scene after completing all endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Quick-time events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78Screamers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78A script over 45,000 words long. The walkthrough takes an average of 3-4 hours to complete.</p>",
